\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Physical evidence for the scheduling contract. (a) MPS cap-only and lifecycle diagnostics retain deadline misses. (b) The scheduler admits every offered 16--128-token Qwen unit and rejects larger classes when recovery debt consumes the window. (c) Whole-path samples remain inside their mode contracts. (d) The fault campaign spans frequent execution and rare terminal events without an observed deadline or invariant violation.}}{16}{figure.caption.34}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:qualification}{{9}{16}{Physical evidence for the scheduling contract. (a) MPS cap-only and lifecycle diagnostics retain deadline misses. (b) The scheduler admits every offered 16--128-token Qwen unit and rejects larger classes when recovery debt consumes the window. (c) Whole-path samples remain inside their mode contracts. (d) The fault campaign spans frequent execution and rare terminal events without an observed deadline or invariant violation}{figure.caption.34}{}}
